薦,土城好吃拉麵店,土城拉麵店推薦,土城人氣拉麵推薦,土城丼飯必吃推薦,土城日式料理推薦,土城平價日式料理,土城好吃日式餐廳,土城特色日式料理,土城特色日式拉麵,土城平價日式美食,土城平價日式餐廳,土城外送拉麵,土城拉麵外送,土城拉麵外帶,土城平價拉麵,土城好吃日本料理,土城平價丼飯,土城必吃丼飯店,金城路拉麵,金城路人氣必吃,金城路外送美食"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-7eiVdBfXJPw/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/j0E8U2lRzbI/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],"新北市土城區延祿里",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[null,1],0,[13,13,22,77,212],["評分和評論","分享你的經驗供他人參考",1,"詳細說明你在這個地點的親身體驗"],null,null,null,null,[[[[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGVmVIQXlhbVJEUmtOTVJUZEhjR1F4TldOS2VrRRAB",["0x0:0x2f0b89510d06e64d",null,1780118613672286,1780118613672286,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113751064363444942297/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["劉晴珠","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIeZTC3F2Xwp2QVIscTNSOdgtOPq6OpWO98UQ0woPHxB9LrhQ\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113751064363444942297?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"113751064363444942297",null,5,11,null,[0,3,1],1,["5 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjLmfSK-dSWAxXBITQIHaTuGGoQpr8GCDMoAA"]]]],null,"3 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[5],null,[["CIABIhAuEEB3sdPVB8BjMpZFszgz",["CIABIhAuEEB3sdPVB8BjMpZFszgz",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMSMqEXtvjqdrxYQKE0zSybTZ8MpDdVjk18xotaZEwlVs4I-DZLckjGM6Lk9QEE9Cjzlwv07AbdM7njFTXXnwwg4b9QofNe4NjvjpvyAMmVzIjkgJ-N7GGcNgpn_YFJoXfAWu6etVAgyr0\u003dk-no",null,[3024,4032]],null,[[3,121.46938000990696,24.988771526219452],[0,90],[3024,4032],75],"JbyaaovzBcHD0PEPpN3j0AY","0ahUKEwjLmfSK-dSWAxXBITQIHaTuGGoQzCcINCgB",["//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhAuEEB3sdPVB8BjMpZFszgz\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv.tactile\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0x2f0b89510d06e64d",